<p>Solomen : or certain SCPs. I understand that Using 076 Able has already been tried and had less than desirable results, but there are still so many environments it seems obvious to try and unleash him on. &quot;Alright, Able, you head down that seemingly endless flight of dark stairs. If you die, we'll interview you when you return.&quot;</p>
<p>As for fearless, the notion with the drug tests is to suggest that for some reason the anomaly is able to inspire a state in the human mind, bypassing most preexisting chemical or hormonal conditions. As far fetched as that sounds, there are studies which indicate that electromagnetic pulses can have profound effects on human emotion.</p>

